                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-2 h-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#A9B3C8] mt-2"></div><span><span class="font-bold">Your account enters a 30-day grace period. You may cancel the deletion by logging in and explicitly confirming cancellation during this period.</span></span></div>
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-2 h-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#A9B3C8] mt-2"></div><span><span class="font-bold">After 30 days, your account and all associated data are permanently deleted, including all business data, inventory records, photos, and account information. This action is irreversible.</span></span></div>
                            </div>
