                            <p><span class="font-bold">Soft deletion within the App:</span> When you delete entities within the App during normal use (such as products or warehouses that are referenced in existing orders), the system may retain certain records in a soft-deleted state to preserve the integrity of your historical data. This is separate from account deletion — upon full account deletion, all data including soft-deleted records is permanently purged.</p>
